用範圍分開。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• 裁示、身分與行動許可各自核對；任務與驗收沿用原流程。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• 判定保留原文與版本；含糊、衝突、無權或版本不明均不補猜。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• ADR 沿用 dev2 格式與配號；實質變更新檔，小修保留原話及歷史。"}]}]}}},{"id":"shape:jm-P5-legend-status-exists-border","typeName":"shape","x":0,"y":0,"rotation":0,"index":"a1","parentId":"shape:jm-P5-legend-status-exists","isLocked":true,"opacity":1,"meta":{"journey":{"kind":"board-legend-border","nodeId":"status-exists","rendered":"\u0000"}},"type":"geo","props":{"w":90,"h":90,"geo":"rectangle","dash":"solid","growY":0,"url":"","scale":0.45,"flipX":false,"flipY":false,"color":"green","labelColor":"black","fill":"none","size":"xl","font":"draw","align":"middle","verticalAlign":"middle","richText":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph"}]}}},{"id":"shape:jm-P1-answer-S01-cli-p1-u08","typeName":"shape","x":550,"y":2318,"rotation":0,"index":"aVNME","parentId":"page:jm-board-P1","isLocked":false,"opacity":1,"meta":{"journey":{"nodeId":"cli-p1-u08","kind":"answer","story":"S01","rendered":"Fact：只讀既有固定commit、不fetch；安全仍待驗。\u0000https://github.com/iamcxa/kc-claude-plugins/blob/main/docs/journey/kc-decision-log/p1-technical-contract.md#cli-p1-u08"}},"type":"note","props":{"color":"light-violet","size":"s","font":"draw","align":"middle","verticalAlign":"middle","labelColor":"black","growY":0,"fontSizeAdjustment":1,"url":"https://github.com/iamcxa/kc-claude-plugins/blob/main/docs/journey/kc-decision-log/p1-technical-contract.md#cli-p1-u08","scale":1,"textLastEditedBy":null,"richText":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fact：只讀既有固定commit、不fetch；安全仍待驗。"}]}]}}},{"id":"shape:jm-P3-status","typeName":"shape","x":990,"y":-296,"rotation":0,"index":"aRaOE","parentId":"page:jm-board-P3","isLocked":false,"opacity":1,"meta":{"journey":{"nodeId":"status","kind":"status","rendered":"STATUS — as of 2026-10-20\nUnproven: 規劃意圖；CLI、交接